 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? A cool box of ice and water bottles is the go to. Make sure the box is bigger than the bottle, so it doesn't melt too fast. A bottle of wine can melt in an instant. Keep it in a cool box, but put it in a separate bag just in case. Yes, it does. Use a bottle that's not the one you want to drink from, though. Fill them halfway and top them up every half hour. That way they stay cold longer.",
